From 6ea3edb4979dabe791fead3d95a9abbf4d324941 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dooset22 <dooset22@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:05:32 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add UWP build for Xbox Series X|S Developer Mode

REXGLUE_UWP=ON builds the SDK as a UWP (app container) app:

- CoreApplication/CoreWindow window and UI loop, CoreWindow swap chain
- Direct3D 12 and DXGI linked directly instead of loaded with LoadLibrary
- Windows.Gaming.Input controller driver and XAudio2 audio driver
  replacing SDL2
- UWP-safe file, memory mapping, threading and event APIs; Win32
  functions missing from the UWP API partition looked up at runtime
- User data and relative log paths in the package's LocalState folder;
  logging to the debugger instead of a console
- fmt's OS module and spdlog's console sinks left out of UWP builds
- FFmpeg configured with its UWP code paths
- rexglue_uwp_app() CMake helper, manifest template and package_uwp.ps1
  to build a signed .msix; uwp-amd64 presets; docs/UWP.md

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01T2Eqt3AmpbNRB9dC5uwqee
